ull px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[9px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
